  "869fb8ae-b4e9-7b4e-8d24-a7a0e31b20d5"],
 "This family is broad enough to include standard neurons and the proposed \
extensions. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f5722b8e-31a9-6a48-b987-bd6441faf1bc"],

