Cell["8.1. Why this matters", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0d940906-ca97-9b41-93c7-d61f345b0802"],

Cell["\<\
This makes explicit that the project is not about one scalar activation. It \
is about a structured internal dynamical object. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"988c7c84-10f2-0346-96a5-cd8074280dc2"],

